[heading]Version 0.4.11[/heading]

[list]
[*]Added client-side destination visual warm-up before multiplayer teleports.
[*]Added a client-side chunk visual refresh around arrival.
[*]Destination visuals are now kept loaded briefly after arrival.
[*]Reduced cases where POI objects such as shutters or vehicles can remain transparent after teleporting even though their collision/state exists.
[*]No save reset required.
[/list]
